      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Authors describe characteristics of this rare disease, as cause of acute abdomen in infancy. They base this on the study of two cases. They establish criteria for differential diagnosis of acute appendicitis, as well as surgical treatment and pathological conditions found during surgery."},
